WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:04.655
When an animation starts is part of the file, and this is where you choose it.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.648
Set it to start on hover, then open the Preview to try it.

3
00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:15.902
Or on click: a click starts it, the next one pauses it.

4
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:24.301
Save the file, and every player and every export starts it the same way.
